    "sourceLanguage": "English",
    "targetLanguage": "German"
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "source": "I couldn't agree more.",
    "target": "Ich stimme voll und ganz zu.",
    "sourceLanguage": "English",
    "targetLanguage": "German"
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "source": "It probably belonged to my great-grandparents.",
    "target": "Es gehörte wahrscheinlich meinen Urgroßeltern.",
    "sourceLanguage": "English",
    "targetLanguage": "German"
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "source": "To celebrate music, I thought I'd share with you my favourite musical facts.",
    "target": "Um die Musik zu feiern, dachte ich, ich teile mit euch meine Lieblingsfakten über Musik.",
    "sourceLanguage": "English",
    "targetLanguage": "German"
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "source": "He was also extremely talented.",
    "target": "Er war auch extrem talentiert.",
    "sourceLanguage": "English",
    "targetLanguage": "German"
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "source": "The oldest musical instrument is the flute.",
    "target": "Das älteste Musikinstrument ist die Flöte.",
    "sourceLanguage": "English",
    "targetLanguage": "German"
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "source": "You can choose from 11 million singers and songs on Spotify.",
    "target": "Auf Spotify kannst du aus 11 Millionen Sängern und Liedern wählen.",
    "sourceLanguage": "English",
    "targetLanguage": "German"
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "source": "The song was so successful that it got a statue.",
    "target": "Das Lied war so erfolgreich, dass es eine Statue bekam.",
    "sourceLanguage": "English",
    "targetLanguage": "German"
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "source": "She was very talented.",
    "target": "Sie war sehr talentiert.",
    "sourceLanguage": "English",
    "targetLanguage": "German"
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "source": "I hope she didn't spill anything on it!",
    "target": "Ich hoffe, sie hat nichts darauf verschüttet!",
    "sourceLanguage": "English",
    "targetLanguage": "German"
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "source": "Your driver will drive you behind your favourite stars for the whole day.",
    "target": "Dein Fahrer wird dich den ganzen Tag hinter deinen Lieblingsstars herfahren.",
    "sourceLanguage": "English",
    "targetLanguage": "German"
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "source": "Paul Sacks and Simon Gray are critics on Superstar.",
    "target": "Paul Sacks und Simon Gray sind Kritiker bei Superstar.",
    "sourceLanguage": "English",
    "targetLanguage": "German"
  },
  {
    "id": 45,
    "source": "You're a brave man.",
    "target": "Du bist ein mutiger Mann.",
    "sourceLanguage": "English",
    "targetLanguage": "German"
  },
  {
    "id": 46,
    "source": "In fact you're not even a background singer.",
    "target": "Tatsächlich bist du nicht einmal ein Backgroundsänger.",
    "sourceLanguage": "English",
    "targetLanguage": "German"
  },
  {
    "id": 47,
    "source": "Sing at home, you're not wearing that suit.",
    "target": "Sing zu Hause, du ziehst diesen Anzug nicht an.",
    "sourceLanguage": "English",
    "targetLanguage": "German"
  },
  {
    "id": 48,
    "source": "Don't be too unhappy.",
    "target": "Sei nicht zu unglücklich.",
    "sourceLanguage": "English",
    "targetLanguage": "German"
  },
  {
    "id": 49,
    "source": "Don't waste our time.",
    "target": "Verschwende nicht unsere Zeit.",
    "sourceLanguage": "English",
    "targetLanguage": "German"
  },
  {
    "id": 50,
    "source": "I feel sad.",
    "target": "Ich fühle mich traurig.",
    "sourceLanguage": "English",
    "targetLanguage": "German"
  },
  {
    "id": 51,
    "source": "I never get tired of listening to music.",
    "target": "Ich habe es nie satt, Musik zu hören.",
    "sourceLanguage": "English",
    "targetLanguage": "German"
  },
  {
    "id": 52,
    "source": "The lyrics in this song should be meaningful.",
    "target": "Der Liedtext in diesem Lied sollte sinnvoll sein.",
    "sourceLanguage": "English",
    "targetLanguage": "German"
  },
  {
    "id": 53,
    "source": "I make up special dances for my fans.",
    "target": "Ich denke mir besondere Tänze für meine Fans aus.",
    "sourceLanguage": "English",
    "targetLanguage": "German"
  },
  {
    "id": 54,
    "source": "I buy a record every week.",
    "target": "Ich kaufe jede Woche eine Schallplatte.",
    "sourceLanguage": "English",
    "targetLanguage": "German"
  },
  {
    "id": 55,
    "source": "He doesn't seem to get old.",
    "target": "Er scheint nicht alt zu werden.",
    "sourceLanguage": "English",
    "targetLanguage": "German"
  },
  {
    "id": 56,
    "source": "I always sing along to the songs I like.",
    "target": "Ich singe immer bei den Liedern mit, die ich mag.",
    "sourceLanguage": "English",
    "targetLanguage": "German"
  },
  {
    "id": 57,
    "source": "I like songs with a good tune.",
    "target": "Ich mag Lieder mit einer guten Melodie.",
    "sourceLanguage": "English",
    "targetLanguage": "German"
  },
  {
    "id": 58,
    "source": "James wanted to come along.",
    "target": "James wollte mitkommen.",
    "sourceLanguage": "English",
    "targetLanguage": "German"
  },
  {
    "id": 59,
    "source": "Where did the concert take place?",
    "target": "Wo fand das Konzert statt?",
    "sourceLanguage": "English",
    "targetLanguage": "German"
  },
  {
    "id": 60,
    "source": "We'll go to the cinema and afterwards to the restaurant.",
    "target": "Wir gehen ins Kino und danach ins Restaurant.",
    "sourceLanguage": "English",
    "targetLanguage": "German"
  },
  {
    "id": 61,
    "source": "Apart from his bad taste in music, my dad's cool.",
    "target": "Abgesehen von seinem schlechten Musikgeschmack ist mein Papa cool.",
    "sourceLanguage": "English",
    "targetLanguage": "German"
  },
  {
    "id": 62,
    "source": "In my opinion, it's the best they've done.",
    "target": "Meiner Meinung nach ist es das Beste, was sie gemacht haben.",
    "sourceLanguage": "English",
    "targetLanguage": "German"
  },
  {
    "id": 63,
    "source": "He seems to be interested in her music.",
    "target": "Er scheint an ihrer Musik interessiert zu sein.",
    "sourceLanguage": "English",
    "targetLanguage": "German"
  }
